{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Chinese-style martial arts game with the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A survival system where players must plan their survival resources wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A construction system that allows players to build various facilities in the game world autonomously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of weather conditions and adventure events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different wilderness areas and towns, with 11 different factions or sects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of interactive NPCs that can engage in high-freedom interactions with player characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A storyline crafted in the direction of visual novels, with numerous side quests and different choices leading to varied subsequent plots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An innovative combat system based on troop deployment and skill hand cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeatable out-of-game talent points that can be played again and again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In summary, this is a game that aims to integrate survival, strategy, sandbox, narrative, and roguelike gameplay elements into one experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3209930?t=1767598294","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3209930?t=1767598294","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209930/93d3d44538e615a5f88ed3705f2bb1ffb562f5cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767598294","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209930/93d3d44538e615a5f88ed3705f2bb1ffb562f5cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767598294","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Chinese-style martial arts game with the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A survival system where players must plan their survival resources wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A construction system that allows players to build various facilities in the game world autonomously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of weather conditions and adventure events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different wilderness areas and towns, with 11 different factions or sects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of interactive NPCs that can engage in high-freedom interactions with player characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A storyline crafted in the direction of visual novels, with numerous side quests and different choices leading to varied subsequent plots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An innovative combat system based on troop deployment and skill hand cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeatable out-of-game talent points that can be played again and again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In summary, this is a game that aims to integrate survival, strategy, sandbox, narrative, and roguelike gameplay elements into one experience.</p>","developers":["\u9ebb\u82b1\u5c0f\u5c0f\u7c73\u8c46\u8c46"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209930/b0fa1eab6be3488094e0bfeee9deaf91c4f2ee98/header.jpg?t=1767598294","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3209930/553118280/f5c3fbfb877e539b3015022efc6df7d649542c7a/17651